    {"text": "The pinned inputs reproduce the exact 42 issue subjects, 42 distinct same-name singleton parents, and seven neighboring catalog rows. The 41+1 result is agreement with the retained roster transcription, not a new legal-source finding.","status": "supported","source_ids": ["worldatlas-retained-packet","worldatlas-followup-packet"]},
